  id: base_spell_sleep
  title: Sleep
  description: This spell plunges the monster into a deep sleep. It cannot move,
    attack, or defend itself. It can break free from the spell immediately or on
    a future turn by rolling 1 red die for each of its spirit points. If it rolls
    a 6, the spell is broken. Does not work on mummies, zombies or skeletons.
